<title>POLAND: Poland rejects all 12-pct fixed bond bids.</title>
<headline>Poland rejects all 12-pct fixed bond bids.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry rejected all five million zlotys worth of bids at its 450 million zloty primary tender of 12-percent fixed bonds due on October 12, 2001, the central bank said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
